:"premiumDefaultSite Solution Template (embedded)","schemaVersion":1.6,"contentGroupId":"dfe6b86cb56f46efb322b9b102d8b701","followersGroupId":"e0c9aeb70c674c1caa400c06be29d3b0","parentInitiativeId":"038ccb463fc24b0e9e33541c49041b2e","children":[],"parentId":"embedded-premium-default-site","collaborationGroupId":"ec1fb27063b9486dbb2608fc4d888d77"},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://tribal-colleges-and-universities-demo-esrifederal.hub.arcgis.com","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":8373,"scoreCompleteness":61,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792386000000,"source":"Esri National Government"},{"id":"6cc746c3462e4b99af174cb2a73f661b","owner":"iscaffid_USCSSI","created":1669623985000,"modified":1669624045000,"guid":null,"name":"Hot_Spots_Colleges_and_Universities_in_the_United_States","title":"Hot_Spots_Colleges_and_Universities_in_the_United_States","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<b>The following report outlines the workflow used to optimize your Find Hot Spots result:<\/b><br /><u><b>Initial Data Assessment.<\/b><\/u><br /><ul><li>There were 6559 valid input features.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>There were 11 outlier locations; these were not used to compute the polygon cell size.<\/li><\/ul><u><b>Incident Aggregation<\/b><\/u><br /><ul><li>The polygon cell size was 86401.0000 Meters.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>The aggregation process resulted in 944 weighted areas.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>Incident Count Properties:<\/li><\/ul><table style='width: 200px;margin-left: 2.5em;border: none;'><tbody><tr><td style='border: none;'>Min<\/td><td style='float:right;border: none;'>1.0000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style='border: none;'>Max<\/td><td style='float: right;border: none;'>226.0000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style='border: none;'>Mean<\/td><td style='float: right;border: none;'>6.9481<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style='border: none;'>Std. Dev.<\/td><td style='float: right;border: none;'>14.1444<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><u><b>Scale of Analysis<\/b><\/u><br /><ul><li>The optimal fixed distance band selected was based on peak clustering found at 613297.3773 Meters.<\/li><\/ul><br /><u><b>Hot Spot Analysis<\/b><\/u><br /><ul><li>There are 383 output features statistically significant based on a FDR correction for multiple testing and spatial dependence.<\/li><\/ul><br /><u><b>Output<\/b><\/u><br /><ul><li>Red output features represent hot spots where high JOIN_COUNT values value cluster.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>Blue output features represent cold spots where low JOIN_COUNT values value cluster.<\/li><\/ul><br />","tags":["Analysis Result","Hot Spots","Colleges and Universities in the United States"],"snippet":"Feature layer generated from Find Hot Spots","thumbnail":"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-170.82418610424546,-14.579215653957013],[171.45945828341243,71.40873845798342]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"english (united states)","properties":{"jobUrl":"https://analysis1.arcgis.com/arcgis/rest/services/tasks/GPServer/FindHotSpots/jobs/j33a37759758045cdbe0493318724bd3e","jobType":"GPServer","jobId":"j33a37759758045cdbe0493318724bd3e","jobStatus":"completed"},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services1.arcgis.com/ZIL9uO234SBBPGL7/arcgis/rest/services/Hot_Spots_Colleges_and_Universities_in_the_United_States/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":64,"scoreCompleteness":78,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792263600000,"source":"Spatial Sciences Institute "},{"id":"43eb0e53b9e343b49bfe74e342ca57e6","owner":"clibby007","created":1614014023000,"modified":1728087518000,"guid":null,"name":"Colleges_and_Universities_Campuses","title":"Colleges and Universities Campuses","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"","tags":["Colleges and Universities Campuses","Education","HIFLD","ARNORTH","543","543RD","543RD GPC"],"snippet":"The College and University Campuses feature class/shapefile is composed of all Post Secondary Education facilities as defined by the Homeland Infrastructure Foundation-Level Data (HIFLD) Colleges and Universities and Supplemental Colleges point feature classes/shapefiles with a POPULATION value greater than or equal to 500. Also included is a subset of campuses with a POPULATION value under 500 or equal to -999. Included are Doctoral/Research Universities, Masters Colleges and Universities, Baccalaureate Colleges, Associates Colleges, Theological seminaries, Medical Schools and other health care professions, Schools of engineering and technology, business and management, art, music, design, Law schools, Teachers colleges, Tribal colleges, and other specialized institutions. ","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-170.74437785899997,-14.323952233999933],[171.378807842,66.90102666300004]],"categories":["/Categories/Infrastructure"],"spatialReference":"4326","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services5.arcgis.com/HDRa0B57OVrv2E1q/arcgis/rest/services/Colleges_and_Universities_Campuses/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],